  "geometry_rule": "Frozen deterministic source-pair rule in helpers/lewm_screen.py: PushT midpoint, inward perpendicular axis rotated -10/0/+10 degrees by source index. Radii12/16/20px, bar half-length30/40/50px radius7px, gates gap100/90/80px offset65px extent180px band7px. Cube uses source reference-route midpoint centre, source axis rotated -10/0/+10deg; radii.009/.012/.015m, bars half-length.024/.030/.036m radius.006m, gates gap.18/.20/.22m offset.12/.13/.14m extent.27m band.006m. No controller outcome enters geometry. Both endpoint clearances must cover unchanged margin plus learned allowance. No outcome-based case replacement.",
  "preparation": "Three fixed inputs per environment, one counted native reset each, native start render, copied recorded target images, geometry derived before episode outcomes. Preserve source identity and all constructor/reset work. Public poses were previously used in historical development, so this is not a globally unseen-scene claim.",
  "readiness": "Six native no-added-hazard episodes per environment. Gate requires >=4 safe completions, zero observed violations, successful zero/native equivalence, correct legal-action contract, and visual policy-input review. Technical failure closes that arm with all costs retained. No automatic TwoRoom substitution.",
  "capture": "Cube retains one owned native renderer per stage. Fresh frames at every policy replan (history_len1, action buffer empty), completion and final capture; frames held between replans are explicitly marked by frame_fresh/frame_actions. This scheduling must pass policy-buffer equivalence software tests. Original physics and observations at model queries unchanged. PushT captures every action.",
  "image_quality": "Check shape224x224RGB uint8 and inspect prepared start/goal and first/quarter/mid/three-quarter/final native-control frames. Save roughness/contrast>0.4 flags solely as inspection aid, not a validated corruption classifier. No adapter stage before manual control review. Subsequent flagged inputs close the arm pending review; all rows/frames retained.",
  "schedule": "Run native/zero six-action probes on pair0 in each environment, then six native no-hazard controls. After independent control-image review, finish all18 native hazard cases and all24 matching untrained cases for each qualifying environment. Paired seeds fixed by environment+10*source_index+repeat. No new training or optimizer comparisons in this screen.",
  "training_readiness": "For a future separately frozen study, native hazard completion must be mixed (1..17 of18), untrained must have strictly more hazard safe completions, no additional violations, no decrease in no-hazard safe completion or engagement, and clean observations. Report paired losses on baseline-successful control pairs. These are development gates, not statistical superiority claims.",
  "accounting": "Charge every reset, constructor physics integration, preparation render, engineering action and failed start. Record world-model encoder calls, predictor batches/candidate rollouts/steps, learned motion checks, adapter calls and elapsed time separately. Same online population/horizon/iteration caps within environment; report actual work.",
  "stopping": "Fresh $1 rental cap and one-hour cutoff. Retain ten-minute preservation reserve before starting any further episode. No budget inheritance, automatic extension, extra rental or retries of outcomes. At most four engineering episodes; stop technical failures for diagnosis and preserve original versions. An arm failing readiness stays closed. Future final-evaluation cases remain untouched.",
  "limitations": [
    "Three distinct source pairs per environment, two planner seeds per condition; planner seeds are not independent physical tasks.",
    "Previously used public-pose inputs, newly frozen geometry grid and seeds. Exploratory development screen, not globally untouched validation.",
    "Frozen LeWM task costs plus learned native-proprioception motion safety. Empirical calibration is not a universal safety guarantee.",
    "No learned adapter or evolutionary advantage claim; real optimizer updates are zero."
  ]
